translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_b5ad07d9:

    # "There, glistening amidst the desert dunes,"
    "저기, 사막의 모래 언덕 사이로 반짝이며,"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:253
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_936719b3:

    # "Half-sunk in the sands, the great Temple of Arakan remains."
    "모래에 반쯤 잠긴 채, 위대한 아라칸 신전이 남아 있다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:254
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_98a94af8:

    # "The entranceway, a great maw of some ancient, arcane old god whom even time seems to have forgotten."
    "입구는 시간조차 잊은 듯한, 어떤 고대의 비전한 옛 신의 거대한 아가리였다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:257
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_c49a55fd:

    # BESHAR @ talk "You head on in and clear what's down there."
    BESHAR @ talk "\"네가 먼저 들어가서 아래에 있는 것들을 처리해.\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:258
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_cca7ef3f:

    # MC @ think "You're not coming in?"
    MC @ think "\"안 들어오는 거야?\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:259
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_213ee4f0:

    # BESHAR @ talk "I'm old... And I can't swing a hammer like I used to."
    BESHAR @ talk "\"난 늙었어... 예전처럼 망치를 휘두를 수도 없고.\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:260
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_6e781ba9:

    # BESHAR @ talk "Afraid I'll just get myself killed down there."
    BESHAR @ talk "\"아래에서 죽을까 봐 겁나.\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:261
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_95e3d421:

    # BESHAR @ talk "I'll stay up here, see if I can find something of use on the surface."
    BESHAR @ talk "\"난 여기 위에 있을게, 지상에서 쓸 만한 걸 찾을 수 있는지 봐야지.\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:262
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_11075717:

    # BESHAR @ talk "Come get me when you've cleared out some of the floors..."
    BESHAR @ talk "\"몇 층을 정리하면 날 부르러 와...\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:266
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_7df91c13:

    # MC @ angry "(Great...)"
    MC @ angry "\"(훌륭하군...)\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:268
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_d9981569:

    # SYPHA @ think "Are you sure about this?"
    SYPHA @ think "\"이거 확실한 거야?\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:269
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_5db34c24:

    # SYPHA @ talk "Old gods... Even I would tread lightly in their domains."
    SYPHA @ talk "\"옛 신들... 나조차도 그들의 영역에서는 조심스럽게 발을 디딜 거야.\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:270
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_9d7f1755:

    # MC @ serious "We're here now... Come on, let's go."
    MC @ serious "\"이미 왔어... 자, 가자.\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:280
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_8c816e0f:

    # "Entering through the great maw, a hollow echo descended deep into the darkness as we stepped down with torches lit."
    "거대한 아가리를 통해 들어서자, 횃불을 든 채 아래로 내려갈 때마다 텅 빈 메아리가 어둠 속 깊이 울려 퍼졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:281
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_2d5f356a:

    # "The hot air slowly turned cold as we descended into that black abyss for what felt like an eternity."
    "검은 심연 속으로 내려가자, 영원처럼 느껴지는 시간 동안 뜨거웠던 공기가 서서히 차가워졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:282
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_65624a8d:

    # "Along the walls leading downward were strange markings in a language I didn't recognize."
    "아래로 이어지는 벽을 따라 내가 알아볼 수 없는 언어로 된 이상한 표식들이 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:283
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_ce777495:

    # MC "(Do these markings mean anything to you?)"
    MC "\"(이 표식들이 너한테 무슨 의미라도 있니?)\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:284
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_8e9767b3:

    # SHYAHTAN "(No... This language is beyond even what I can decipher.)"
    SHYAHTAN "\"(아니... 이 언어는 내가 해독할 수 있는 범위를 넘어서는군.)\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:286
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_76d552a7:

    # "At last, we arrived at a great hallway."
    "마침내, 우리는 거대한 복도에 도착했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:287
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_160ce10d:

    # "A massive bridge stretched across a vast chasm that led into deep darkness."
    "거대한 다리가 깊은 어둠으로 이어지는 광활한 균열을 가로질러 뻗어 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:288
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_bb426e9d:

    # "The bridge itself appeared to be held up by a great stone titan, bearing it upon his shoulders."
    "다리 자체는 거대한 석상 타이탄이 어깨로 떠받치고 있는 듯 보였다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:289
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_8c73fbc1:

    # "Decorating the walls were statues of strange creatures, each holding colossal orbs of different colors: red, blue, green, and purple."
    "벽을 장식하는 것은 기묘한 생명체들의 조각상이었고, 각각은 붉은색, 파란색, 초록색, 보라색의 거대한 구체를 들고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:290
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_1de37e09:

    # "There were no bodies, no signs of a great struggle."
    "시체도, 거대한 투쟁의 흔적도 없었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:292
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_5176d36d:

    # "Only a forgotten tomb, its lips sealed, unable to tell what had come before."
    "오직 잊혀진 무덤, 입술은 봉인된 채, 이전에 무슨 일이 있었는지 말해주지 못하는."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:294
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_b6e07528:

    # "... To the left and right, great ruinous archways still stood proud, with the remnants of rotting doors on both sides."
    "... 좌우에는, 위대한 폐허의 아치길이 여전히 당당히 서 있었고, 양쪽에는 썩어가는 문의 잔해가 남아 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:295
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_beshar_golem_journey_go_3e2ce9aa:

    # "{i}What now?{/i}"
    "{i}이제 어쩌지?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:299
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_bridge_cantcross_93c01fd1:

    # MC "(The stone titan holds the bridge at an angle, making it impossible to cross.)"
    MC "\"(석상 타이탄이 다리를 비스듬히 들고 있어서 건널 수가 없군.)\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:306
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_dials_first_enter_72fb50a0:

    # MC @ talk "What is this place?"
    MC @ talk "\"여긴 뭐 하는 곳이지?\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:308
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_dials_first_enter_2b7d872a:

    # MARKUS @ talk "It looks like some kind of... sacrificial chamber?"
    MARKUS @ talk "\"뭔가... 제물의 방 같은 건가?\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:310
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_dials_first_enter_1388e84d:

    # SYPHA @ talk "The old gods did have a rather nasty penchant for demanding blood sacrifices."
    SYPHA @ talk "\"옛 신들은 피의 제물을 요구하는 아주 고약한 취향이 있었지.\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:311
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_dials_first_enter_7e093939:

    # MARKUS @ think "And here I figured blood sacrifices were something you would appreciate!"
    MARKUS @ think "\"그리고 보니 피의 제물 같은 건 네가 좋아할 줄 알았는데!\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:312
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_dials_first_enter_2a847363:

    # SYPHA @ talk "We value trickery and deception. It is honorable to outmaneuver your enemies."
    SYPHA @ talk "\"우리는 계략과 기만을 중시하지. 적을 속임수로 능가하는 것이 명예로운 일이야.\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:313
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_dials_first_enter_b22933f0:

    # SYPHA @ talk "To see the fear in your enemies' eyes when they realize you have outplayed them before you plunge the knife."
    SYPHA @ talk "\"칼을 찌르기 직전에 적들이 네게 속았다는 걸 깨달을 때의 그 공포를 보는 것 말이야.\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:314
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_dials_first_enter_d59ee97e:

    # SYPHA @ sad "... But the old gods are different."
    SYPHA @ sad "\"... 하지만 옛 신들은 달라.\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:315
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_dials_first_enter_3e304de5:

    # SYPHA @ sad "{i}They always win with their deals.{/i}"
    SYPHA @ sad "\"{i}그들은 항상 거래에서 이기지.{/i}\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:316
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_dials_first_enter_41fd16c9:

    # SYPHA @ smug "And where is the fun in that for a Demorai?"
    SYPHA @ smug "\"그런 게 데모라이에게 무슨 재미가 있겠어?\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:317
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_dials_first_enter_6190873f:

    # SYPHA @ happy "Where is the great {i}game?{/i}"
    SYPHA @ happy "\"위대한 {i}게임{/i}은 어디에 있지?\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:318
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_dials_first_enter_078e2c2b:

    # MARKUS @ angry "I swear you Demorai are stranger by the minute."
    MARKUS @ angry "\"맹세코 너희 데모라이는 1분 1초가 더 이상해져 가는군.\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:319
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_dials_first_enter_5ac0a6ab:

    # SYPHA @ talk "To me, you Alderians are the curiosity."
    SYPHA @ talk "\"내게는, 너희 알데리안이 호기심의 대상이야.\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:320
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_dials_first_enter_c101a51c:

    # MC @ serious "Enough bickering. Let's look around."
    MC @ serious "\"말다툼은 그만. 주변을 둘러보자.\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:325
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_dials_shrines_1_58eff06c:

    # "{i}A jester mask of gold and emerald, melded with fire to Prince Cashan's face so the gods could see he could not hide behind his deceptions anymore. - Boritan IV{/i}"
    "{i}금과 에메랄드의 광대 가면, 불로 카샨 왕자의 얼굴에 녹여 붙였으니 신들이 그가 더 이상 속임수 뒤에 숨을 수 없음을 보도록. - 보리탄 4세{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:328
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_dials_shrines_2_d1d3e72f:

    # "{i}Upon his weary head, King Nashur's crown of blades, a reminder of the blood paid to lay it there. - Achamon V{/i}"
    "{i}지친 그의 머리 위로, 나슈르 왕의 칼날 왕관은 거기 놓이기 위해 치른 피를 상기시킨다. - 아차몬 5세{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:331
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_dials_shrines_3_725b70d5:

    # "{i}Lord Yunitan's wife weeps as she watches her husband march to war against the gods... She knows he has already made a widow of her even while he still breathes. - {b}The name alongside it is etched out.{/b}{/i}"
    "{i}유니탄 경의 아내는 남편이 신들을 상대로 전쟁에 나서는 것을 지켜보며 눈물 흘린다... 그녀는 그가 아직 숨 쉬는 동안에도 이미 자신이 과부가 되었음을 안다. - {b}곁의 이름은 지워져 있다.{/b}{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:334
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_dials_shrines_4_ffeef6be:

    # "{i}Imatan saw the pain that was to come to the world and could take no more. Now he sleeps and dreams of a better world. - Kaina I{/i}"
    "{i}이마탄은 세상에 닥칠 고통을 보았고 더는 견딜 수 없었다. 이제 그는 잠들어 더 나은 세상을 꿈꾼다. - 카이나 1세{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:337
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_dials_shrines_5_86cca131:

    # "{i}Thalaya gifts fish to the village... the village gifts Thalaya their children to the waves. - {b}The name alongside it is etched out.{/b}{/i}"
    "{i}탈라야가 마을에 물고기를 선물하니... 마을은 탈라야에게 그들의 아이들을 파도에 바친다. - {b}곁의 이름은 지워져 있다.{/b}{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:340
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_dials_shrines_6_e2d613c3:

    # "{i}Beneath restless blood moons, the wolf god Lumirar demands his pound of flesh. - Vitigo III{/i}"
    "{i}불안한 핏빛 달 아래서, 늑대 신 루미라르가 그의 몫의 살점을 요구한다. - 비티고 3세{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:348
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_golem_temple_dials_choice_f1e3080d:

    # "The dial clicked into place, refusing to budge."
    "다이얼이 제자리에 딸깍 고정되며, 더는 움직이지 않았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:349
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_golem_temple_dials_choice_c525341d:

    # MC "(Something just clicked!)"
    MC "\"(뭔가 방금 딸깍 소리가 났다!)\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:356
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_golem_temple_dials_choice_9fc98b9d:

    # "As I spin the dial and try to lock it into place, a small, sharp blade shoots out and pierces my hand!"
    "다이얼을 돌려 제자리에 고정하려는 순간, 작고 날카로운 칼날이 튀어나와 내 손을 꿰뚫었다!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:359
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_golem_temple_dials_choice_e97be069:

    # MC "FUCK!"
    MC "\"씨발!\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:362
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_golem_temple_dials_choice_d779e727:

    # "As I spin the dial and try to lock it into place, and as I do so, I feel one of the potions I carry shatter!"
    "다이얼을 돌려 제자리에 고정하려 하자, 그 순간 내가 지닌 포션 중 하나가 산산조각나는 것이 느껴졌다!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:363
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_golem_temple_dials_choice_c812f041:

    # MC "What the fuck...?"
    MC "\"뭐야 씨발...?\""

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:365
translate kr qst_BigTroubleLHamun_golem_temple_dials_choice_331165d4:

    # "As I spin the dial and try to lock it into place, I suddenly look down to feel some of my coins turn to sand!"
    "다이얼을 돌려 제자리에 고정하려는 순간, 갑자기 아래를 보니 내 동전 일부가 모래로 변해 있었다!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:368
